1
00:00:00,146 --> 00:00:05,434
Part 6 mein godown aur inventory management: naya godown, racks,

2
00:00:05,434 --> 00:00:12,869
product ko rack par rakhna, batch-wise stock, stock value, audited adjustment, quarantine,

3
00:00:12,869 --> 00:00:16,174
low stock aur godowns ke beech transfer.

4
00:00:17,119 --> 00:00:20,637
Masters mein Godowns and racks kholiye.

5
00:00:20,637 --> 00:00:26,860
Hamare paas do godown hain: Medoro Main Godown aur Kanke Road Godown.

6
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:34,707
Har godown ka code, GSTIN, licence, racks ki ginti aur cost par stock value dikhti hai.

7
00:00:35,385 --> 00:00:37,561
Naya godown jodte hain.

8
00:00:37,561 --> 00:00:39,359
Add godown kholiye.

9
00:00:39,359 --> 00:00:43,427
Naam: Dhanbad Depot, code DHN, aur address.

10
00:00:43,427 --> 00:00:52,037
Professional plan mein teen godown tak, aur Enterprise mein bees tak godown mil sakte hain.

11
00:00:52,693 --> 00:00:53,498
Ab racks.

12
00:00:53,498 --> 00:00:57,705
Har rack ka code, zone aur pick order hota hai.

13
00:00:57,705 --> 00:01:05,223
Pick list isi order mein chalti hai, taaki picker ko baar-baar peeche na jaana pade.

14
00:01:05,223 --> 00:01:08,892
Cold chain wale rack alag mark hote hain.

15
00:01:08,892 --> 00:01:11,577
Ek naya rack A-07 banate hain.

16
00:01:12,243 --> 00:01:18,709
Product ko rack par rakhne ke liye product aur rack chuniye aur Place dabaiye.

17
00:01:18,709 --> 00:01:22,274
Naya Levocet syrup rack A-07 par rakh diya.

18
00:01:22,274 --> 00:01:26,999
Ab picking ke samay picker ko seedha rack number dikhega.

19
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:39,908
Ab Stock and transfers kholiye.

20
00:01:39,908 --> 00:01:48,222
Yahan har batch ki line hai: product, batch number, expiry, rack, packs, quarantine,

21
00:01:48,222 --> 00:01:49,509
cost aur MRP.

22
00:01:49,509 --> 00:01:52,676
Upar kul stock value dikhti hai.

23
00:01:53,330 --> 00:02:01,064
Stock sirf GRN, invoice, return, claim, transfer ya audited adjustment se hi badalta hai.

24
00:02:01,064 --> 00:02:04,366
Koi seedha number edit nahi kar sakta.

25
00:02:04,366 --> 00:02:11,926
Search mein Febrinil likhiye: iske alag-alag batches, alag expiry ke saath dikhte hain.

26
00:02:12,579 --> 00:02:19,471
Agar ginti mein fark mile, jaise ek strip toot gayi, toh Stock adjustment use kariye.

27
00:02:19,471 --> 00:02:24,660
Batch chuniye, minus 2 units likhiye, aur reason zaroor daaliye.

28
00:02:24,660 --> 00:02:30,335
Yeh adjustment audit trail mein naam aur samay ke saath darj hota hai.

29
00:02:30,992 --> 00:02:38,122
Quarantine ka matlab hai woh maal jo bika nahi ja sakta: chemist ka lautaya hua expired ya

30
00:02:38,122 --> 00:02:38,994
toota maal.

31
00:02:38,994 --> 00:02:45,253
Yeh stock alag column mein rehta hai aur supplier claim ke liye ruka rehta hai.

32
00:02:45,253 --> 00:02:48,580
Hum ise Part 14 mein detail mein dekhenge.

33
00:02:49,236 --> 00:02:55,029
Low stock pehchanne ke liye dashboard par Products below reorder level ka link hai,

34
00:02:55,029 --> 00:03:00,961
aur Business intelligence mein automatic reorder suggestions hain, jo bikri ki speed,

35
00:03:00,961 --> 00:03:04,520
lead time aur safety stock se quantity batate hain.

36
00:03:05,167 --> 00:03:07,013
Ab godown transfer.

37
00:03:07,013 --> 00:03:10,899
Stock tab par Request transfer form hai.

38
00:03:10,899 --> 00:03:16,630
Batch chuniye, kis godown mein bhejna hai, aur kitne units.

39
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:19,059
Request transfer dabaiye.

40
00:03:19,714 --> 00:03:27,385
Transfer teen kadam mein hota hai: request, approve aur bhejna, phir doosre godown mein receive.

41
00:03:27,385 --> 00:03:34,258
Jab tak maal raaste mein hai, woh kisi bhi godown ke bikne wale stock mein nahi ginta.

42
00:03:34,258 --> 00:03:37,614
Is tarah stock kabhi do jagah nahi dikhta.

43
00:03:38,263 --> 00:03:43,467
Yaad rakhiye: har mahine physical count karke adjustment kariye,

44
00:03:43,467 --> 00:03:49,322
expiry ke paas wala maal pehle nikaliye, aur reorder level sahi rakhiye.

45
00:03:49,322 --> 00:03:54,363
Isse shortage bhi nahi hogi aur expiry ka nuksan bhi kam hoga.
